pi-gen-fixes.patch: applied by bin/build-image to a fresh clone of upstream
pi-gen (arm64 branch). git apply ignores this text before the first diff.

Adds skopeo to the pi-gen build container. Our stage
(our-stage/01-setup-docker-compose/00-run.sh) uses `skopeo copy` to pre-pull
the app's Docker images into the rootfs, so the Pi boots with them
without network access.

If upstream changes this line and the patch stops applying, regenerate it
against a fresh clone of the arm64 branch.

diff --git i/Dockerfile w/Dockerfile
index 29a8c8f..7bfa223 100644
--- i/Dockerfile
+++ w/Dockerfile
@@ -6,7 +6,7 @@ ENV DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive
 RUN apt-get -y update && \
     apt-get -y install --no-install-recommends \
         git vim parted \
-        quilt coreutils qemu-user debootstrap zerofree zip dosfstools e2fsprogs\
+        quilt coreutils qemu-user debootstrap zerofree zip dosfstools e2fsprogs skopeo\
         libcap2-bin rsync grep udev xz-utils curl xxd file kmod bc \
         ca-certificates fdisk gpg pigz arch-test \
     && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*
